  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> be the set of all complex numbers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math> satisfying <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>.</mo></math> If the complex number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math> is such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math> is the maximum of the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>:</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then the principal argument of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
